# Where the charter enquiry form POSTs.
#
# The site is a static build, so the form needs an external endpoint rather
# than a server route. Any service that accepts a form-encoded POST works:
# Formspark, Formspree, Basin, Netlify Forms. Set this and rebuild.
#
# Leave unset in development — the form renders with a visible dev warning
# instead of silently posting nowhere.
PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=
